Media
-----
All textures (mods/bc/textures/, menu/, screenshot.png), models
(mods/bc/models/) and sounds (mods/bc/sounds/) are released under
Creative Commons Zero 1.0 Universal (CC0-1.0):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Credits
-------
- Textures and models are generated by tools/make_assets.py.
- Rain, wind, fire, ignition, eating, drinking, howl and growl sounds are
  synthesized by tools/make_sounds.py.
- Footstep, impact, cloth, book, knife, door, rock, water and woosh sounds
  are converted from the "Impact Sounds", "RPG Audio" and "Foley Sounds"
  packs by Kenney (https://kenney.nl), licensed CC0-1.0.

AI disclosure
-------------
This game was made with substantial AI assistance. The code, the asset
generator scripts and therefore all generated textures, models and synthesized
sounds were written by Claude (Anthropic) under the direction of Matt Koski,
who designed, play-tested and published it.
